{
  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "To prevent patients from booking procedure rooms online, go to **Scheduling > Visit Types**, select the procedure visit type(s), and clear the **Available Online** checkbox. Then, under **Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability**, make sure the providers who should not receive those online requests are not designated to accept online bookings. Only visit types marked as online‑eligible and providers with active, published schedules will appear to patients."
}
